{
 "_about": "Howard R. Garis's (1873-1962) Uncle Wiggily books and Bed Time Stories animal series, first printed as newspaper bedtime stories. The fourteen Charles E. Graham and A. L. Burt picture pamphlets hold one to three stories each and print their titles only in the pictures, so they are cited by running paragraph. Dated by their title pages or Gutenberg's Original publication line, 1910 to 1926; Curly and Floppy Twistytail, Umboo, Buddy and Brighteyes Pigg and Neddie and Beckie Stubtail are undated in the text, and Gutenberg cleared them as US public domain. Added at the coordinator's standing relay (2026-10-02/03: choose public-domain storytellers batches; Adam may veto). On 2026-10-17 every other English text by Howard R. Garis at Gutenberg was added (29 more books; dates are as each title page gives them, and many are undated in the text), at the coordinator's relay of Adam's keep-going message (Adam may veto). Second transcriptions of titles already here (2) and shared or misattributed files are listed in _excluded.",
